  "id": "dyadic-relationship",
  "term": "dyadic relationship",
  "definition": "A dyadic relationship is a social relationship between two people, understood as an ongoing interaction in which each person affects the other. In this view, the relationship’s quality depends on how the pair’s shared pattern of relating fits with each person’s way of maintaining individuality while also connecting with the other.",
